  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3003.08 Obtaining a Hardship Registration After Registration Plates Have Been Returned to the Department.\n\n(a) Any person who qualifies for a hardship registration and requests it after the person’s registration plates have been returned to the department shall:\n\n(1) Comply with the requirements set forth in Saf-C 3003.03; and\n\n(2) Pay the appropriate registration plate fee.\n\nSource. #5027, eff 12-19-90; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96, EXPIRED: 7-23-04\n\nNew. #8181, eff 9-25-04 (from Saf-C 3003.10); ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13279, eff 10-19-21",
